{
  "name": "telemetry-catch-up",
  "description": "Real buffered catch-up, combined sample/event paging and all four reset reasons. Owner Alpaca selection and cadence settings round-trip through the revision-guarded API. Additive adapter_status reports sanitized state/counters and isolated priority; missing fields remain compatible with earlier v1 servers. Optional card_data supplies bounded source-receipt ages and clipped history; clients keep accepting servers that omit it. Full retained-session analysis is a bounded derived projection and does not record a raw-sample fetch. Contract 1.2: every page carries boot_id, the boot domain of next_cursor, so a client stores both together and sends them back unchanged.",
  "contract_version": 1,
